# --- things that must never be committed -----------------------------------
#
# The test harness (mami-smoke.js) lives outside this repo, in a temp folder, so
# there is nothing to ignore for it here. These are for the case where someone
# runs it from inside the project instead.

# Screenshot output and the throwaway Chrome profile the harness creates.
shots/
profile/

# Never push dependencies: start.ng never runs npm, and the game is plain ES
# modules with three.js vendored in vendor/.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# OS junk.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- deliberately NOT ignored ----------------------------------------------
#
# vendor/three.module.min.js  three.js is vendored, not loaded from a CDN.
#                            start.ng warns about external scripts, so this file
#                            has to be committed.
# cover.png                  start.ng picks this up as the game's card picture.
# index.html / src/*.js      the game itself.
#
# There is no pattern here that can match those four, and none should be added.